OL,3,GNEWSABirds return to waterfowl park
OL,4,Aafter oil vandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,FResident birds have returned to
OL,7,FBroughshane Waterfowl Park after an oil
OL,8,Fspill which caused the death of 13 of
OL,9,Fthe flock.
OL,11,FThe popular attraction in County Antrim
OL,12,Fwas forced to close after a nearby home
OL,13,Fheating oil tank was vandalised,
OL,14,Fcausing the oil spill into the pond.
OL,16,FIn a post on social media, the
OL,17,Fattraction confirmed that work is still
OL,18,Funderway to address the oil
OL,19,Fcontamination and that a number of pens
OL,20,Fremain out of bounds.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
